{#
settings/_unified_inbox_accounts.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Which unified inbox each account is listed in (#265). One select per account,
posted the moment it changes (ui--auto-submit), like the switches elsewhere on
these pages.

Here, beside the inboxes, rather than on each row of Settings → Mail accounts:
that row is a strip of icon buttons, and a select there would be the one control
of its kind — while here the reader sees the inboxes they are choosing between.

Other is one of the choices, and choosing it is how an account is taken out of
the reader's own inboxes. A switched-off account is listed too, marked: its
place is kept for when it is switched back on, and nothing of it is listed in
any inbox meanwhile.

Accepts:
  inboxes     UnifiedInbox[]    every inbox of the reader's, in order
  accounts    Account[]         every account, in the reader's order
  inboxOf     array<int, int>   account id => inbox id
#}
<ul class="divide-y divide-line">
    {% for account in accounts %}
        <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5" data-unified-inbox-account="{{ account.id }}">
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <p class="truncate text-sm font-medium {{ account.mailEnabled ? 'text-ink' : 'text-ink-faint' }}">{{ account.displayAddress }}</p>
                {% if not account.mailEnabled %}
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.unified_inboxes.account_off'|trans }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_inboxes_assign', { account: account.id }) }}"
                  data-controller="ui--auto-submit" class="shrink-0">
                <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-inboxes') }}">
                <select name="inbox"
                        data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                        aria-label="{{ 'settings.unified_inboxes.account_label'|trans({ '%account%': account.displayAddress }) }}"
                        class="h-8 max-w-[14rem] rounded-pane border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-sm text-ink">
                    {% for inbox in inboxes %}
                        <option value="{{ inbox.id }}" {{ inboxOf[account.id] is defined and inboxOf[account.id] == inbox.id ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                            {{ unified_inbox_name(inbox) }}{% if inbox.isOther %} — {{ 'settings.unified_inboxes.other_option'|trans }}{% endif %}
                        </option>
                    {% endfor %}
                </select>
                <noscript>
                    <button type="submit" class="h-8 px-2.5 rounded-pane border border-line text-xs">{{ 'settings.unified_inboxes.save'|trans }}</button>
                </noscript>
            </form>
        </li>
    {% else %}
        <li class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.unified_inboxes.no_accounts'|trans }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>
